    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers are delighted to bring no.117 Boroimhe Beech to the market. This well presented 3-bedroom end of terrace property is located in a highly sought after development and is presented in pristine condition. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, large lounge with feature fire, guest WC, kitchen/dining area with utility room just off kitchen and doors to a rear garden.  Upstairs there are 3 spacious bedrooms including a master bedroom with en-suite and a large, family bathroom. The property has a designated car space fitted with electric car charger.  \r\n\r\nThere is a wide range of local amenities nearby such as a primary school, shops, bus service to city centre via port tunnel on Swords Express, Swords and Malahide Village, Airside Retail Park, Dublin Airport and M1 and M50 motorways"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t4.52 x 1.12\tDecorative timber floor, coat rack, wired for alarm, radiator cover, coving \r\n \r\nLiving Room \t4.67 x 4.02         Decorative timber floor, feature fireplace, blinds, radiator cover, custom built bookshelf \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t5.29 x 3.81\tTiled, fully fitted kitchen, oven, electric hob, exactor fan, breakfast bar  \r\n\t\t \r\nGuest WC         2.74 x 3.10   Decorative timber flooring, wc, whb, mirror \r\n\r\nUtility Room   \t1.44 x 1.43      Plumbed and shelved with extra storage   \r\n \r\nStairs/Landing      Decorative timber flooring, Hot press, access to attic\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom  \t3.3 x 3.02\tDecorative timber flooring, fitted wardrobe, blinds, coving\r\n\r\nEn Suite \t1.86 x 1.55\tTiled floors & walls, standalone shower with waterfall head, vanity unit, towel rail \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t3.69 x 3.2\tDecorative timber flooring, fitted wardrobe \r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom         2 x 3.94\tTiled floor & walls, bath suite with shower, wc, whb, mirror\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \t1.96 x 1.9     Decorative timber floor, fitted unit \r\n \r\nGarden\t\tFenced and walled, lawn, patio area, garden shed, East facing , tap, electricity sockets, flower bed, mature planting"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
